WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.096
Step 1. Open the preview.

1.2
00:00:02.096 --> 00:00:06.452
The preview shows which codes the rules of a valueset give.

1.3
00:00:06.452 --> 00:00:10.735
Select Preview, and Care opens the Valueset Preview panel.

1.4
00:00:10.735 --> 00:00:13.155
The preview saves nothing.

2.1
00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:19.364
Step 2. Check the codes. Care lists up to 20 concepts that match the rules.

2.2
00:00:19.364 --> 00:00:24.155
Each concept shows its name, its Code, and its System.

3.1
00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:26.499
Step 3. Search for a concept.

3.2
00:00:26.499 --> 00:00:30.904
Type a concept name in Search for a concept in this valueset.

3.3
00:00:30.904 --> 00:00:34.653
To narrow the results, type more of the name.

4.1
00:00:34.653 --> 00:00:39.737
Step 4. Close the preview. Select the close button in the panel header.

4.2
00:00:39.737 --> 00:00:44.799
If the codes are not correct, change the rules, then preview again.
